    -> Gather: 4 workers, parallel scan on t10  (cost=*** rows=***)
        -> Limit: 101 row(s)  (cost=*** rows=***)
            -> Parallel covering index range scan on t10 using idx4 over (c1 < 2)  (cost=*** rows=***)

