test.t1	analyze	status	OK
EXPLAIN format=tree SELECT v FROM t1 WHERE i1 = 1 AND v = 'a' AND pk < 3;
EXPLAIN
-> Gather: 4 workers, parallel scan on t1  (cost=*** rows=***)
    -> Parallel covering index range scan on t1 using v_idx over (v = 'a' AND i1 = 1 AND pk < 3)  (cost=*** rows=***.25)

